# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. `.env.local` is gitignored at the repo root.
# Do not commit real keys. Do not put keys in Cursor cloud agent environments.
#
# Chapter TTS generate (Phase 3+ on a trusted laptop):
#   ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_key_here
#   make generate-chapter-audio UNIT=chapter-observer-patterns-front-matter-introduction
#
# Listen UI needs no enable env var — it appears only for chapters with available
# installed audio. Local E2E: generate + install site manifest. Production stays
# dark until available audio is shipped to the live install (Kevin’s go-ahead).
#
# Ordinary plan/list/validate targets do not need this variable.

# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
